{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Terra-7",
    "steam_appid": 3721470,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/d80382293f2d6db71c5b029ce2888c6f.avif?t=1747842226\" width=512 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terra-7</strong> is a business simulation game set on an alien planet, inspired by management games like <i>Two Point Hospital</i> and colony sims like <i>RimWorld</i>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a company to extract, process, and sell resources, while taking care of your employees\u2019 needs and facing the dangers of a complex alien ecosystem.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire employees to grow your company!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New hires will be attracted by high salaries and quality of life: to keep them happy, you\u2019ll need to provide housing, food, and recreational services\u2014building a self-sufficient city around them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend your company from threats or your employees will start to worry!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0A real-time atmospheric simulation moves toxic fumes and smog across the map with the wind: use mountains as natural defenses or build artificial barriers to help your community thrive in safety!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/d80382293f2d6db71c5b029ce2888c6f.avif?t=1747842226\" width=512 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terra-7</strong> is a business simulation game set on an alien planet, inspired by management games like <i>Two Point Hospital</i> and colony sims like <i>RimWorld</i>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a company to extract, process, and sell resources, while taking care of your employees\u2019 needs and facing the dangers of a complex alien ecosystem.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire employees to grow your company!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New hires will be attracted by high salaries and quality of life: to keep them happy, you\u2019ll need to provide housing, food, and recreational services\u2014building a self-sufficient city around them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend your company from threats or your employees will start to worry!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0A real-time atmospheric simulation moves toxic fumes and smog across the map with the wind: use mountains as natural defenses or build artificial barriers to help your community thrive in safety!</p>",
    "short_description": "A company management simulation set on an alien planet. Extract, transform, and sell never seen before minerals and plants. Gain the trust of your employees, as you resist the hazards of a complex ecosystem and the requests of a ruthless market.",
